    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Fine-tuning in miniature, on text you supply. A tiny character-level transformer (2 layers, byte tokens) first learns from twenty short children's stories, then trains further on six science facts. Perplexity on the facts falls from 75.0 to 1.03, and the continuation of \"Water boils\" changes from \"Water boils over the lat oudedoter.\" to \"Water boils at 100 degrees Celsiulteumen.\": the first fact word for word until the 32-byte window runs out. Both are measured on the facts it was fine-tuned on, so they show memorisation, not understanding. Perplexity on the stories rises from 1.85 to 25.5: the model forgets what it is no longer shown.\n\n迷你版的微調，用你自己的文字。一個很小的字元級 transformer（2 層，byte token）先從二十則短短的兒童故事學習，再用六條科學事實繼續訓練。事實的 perplexity 從 75.0 降到 1.03，\"Water boils\" 的接續從 \"Water boils over the lat oudedoter.\" 變成 \"Water boils at 100 degrees Celsiulteumen.\"：逐字重現第一條事實，直到 32 byte 的視窗用完。兩者都是在用來微調的那些事實上量的，所以顯示的是記憶，不是理解。故事的 perplexity 從 1.85 升到 25.5：模型會忘掉不再看到的東西。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-files",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": -480
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Point the two TextCorpusDataset nodes at your own .txt files (one passage per line). The byte tokenizer needs no download and covers any language; a real model would start from downloaded pretrained weights instead of this first TrainingLoop.\n\n把兩個 TextCorpusDataset 節點指向你自己的 .txt 檔（每行一段）。byte tokenizer 不需要下載，任何語言都能用；真正的模型會從下載的預訓練權重開始，取代這裡的第一個 TrainingLoop。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "stories",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -480
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
